            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 46-year old lady presented to the AMU with chest pain and shortness of breath. She weighed 345 kg. She was normally mobile up to 10 metres but had become bedbound over the past week with increasing shortness of breath.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
